{"title":"Public Choice Outreach Conference!","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/915015479/0/marginalrevolution~Public-Choice-Outreach-Conference.html","date":1742296724000,"content":"<p>The annual Public Choice Outreach Conference is a crash course in public choice. The conference is designed for undergraduates and graduates in a wide variety of fields. It’s entirely free. Indeed scholarships are available! The conference will be held Friday May 30-Sunday June 1, 2025, near Washington, DC in Arlington, VA. Lots of great speakers. More details in the poster. Please <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://publicchoice.gmu.edu/center-programs/public-choice-outreach-conference-2025\">encourage your students to apply</a>.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Outreach-2025.jpg\" width=\"791\" height=\"1024\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Outreach-2025.jpg 791w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Outreach-2025-232x300.jpg 232w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Outreach-2025-768x994.jpg 768w\" /></p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/public-choice-outreach-conference-3.html\">Public Choice Outreach Conference!</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/915015479/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/915015479/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/915015479/marginalrevolution,https%3a%2f%2fmarginalrevolution.com%2fwp-content%2fuploads%2f2025%2f03%2fOutreach-2025.jpg\"><img height=\"2